    narr:narration """The architectural shift from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB is presented as a [settled migration decision](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786267378045_1), framed by [authoritative summary bullets](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786267378045_3) that establish a clear [Q3 2026 timeline](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786267378045_5). The justification for this transition relies on [quantified performance and cost metrics](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786267378045_2), specifically citing a 10x improvement in analytical query speed. This approach aligns with a broader organizational pattern where [platform migrations are communicated as ratified facts](narr:Narrative_DatabasePlatformMigrationDecisions) rather than open proposals, and [performance and cost figures](narr:Narrative_PerformanceCostJustificationForMigrations) serve as the primary currency for internal validation.""" ;
